<section class="relative max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 pt-16 pb-20 sm:pt-24 sm:pb-28 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="shape-block top-8 right-4 w-28 h-28 sm:w-40 sm:h-40 bg-clay" data-parallax="0.12" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shape-block bottom-4 right-24 sm:right-40 w-10 h-10 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 bg-butter rotate-12" data-parallax="0.22" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="shape-block bottom-16 left-0 w-16 h-16 sm:w-24 sm:h-24 bg-sage" data-parallax="0.08" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <p class="reveal inline-block bg-ink text-cream text-sm font-medium px-3 py-1 mb-6" style="animation-delay: 0.05s;">
    學生 &middot; 新竹縣兒少委員
  </p>

  <h1 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-7xl text-ink mb-6 leading-[1.05]">
    <span data-text-reveal>Yaya 林</span>
  </h1>

  <p class="reveal text-lg sm:text-xl text-ink-light max-w-xl leading-relaxed" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
    這裡記錄我的生活、公共參與的觀察，還有一些讓我開心的小事。
  </p>

  <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4" style="animation-delay: 0.45s;">
    <a
      href="/blog"
      data-magnetic
      class="px-6 py-3 bg-clay text-cream text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-ink transition-colors"
